{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53461","headline":"答伏牛和尚（题拟） · 伏牛小师","name":"答伏牛和尚（题拟）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"鱼龙未变志常存，变了还教海气浑。\n两眼不曾窥小水，一心专拟透龙门。\n千回下网终难系，万度垂钩誓不天。\n待我一朝鳞甲备，解将云雨洒乾坤。\n（见《祖堂集》卷十五）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"伏牛小师","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53461.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53461","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}